C_8_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution ]]\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/FISgn9laDaI\">https://youtu.be/FISgn9laDaI</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_The_Power_of_Logic.281_to_25_Full_Solution.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_The_Power_of_Logic(1_to_25_Full_Solution)\">Video Solution by The Power of Logic(1 to 25 Full Solution)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=13\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by The Power of Logic(1 to 25 Full Solution)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Xm4ZGND9WoY\">https://youtu.be/Xm4ZGND9WoY</a>\n</p><p>~Hayabusa1\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=14\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_8\" title=\"2019 AMC 8\">2019 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2019 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2019 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&a